{"batchcomplete":"","query":{"pages":{"91491466":{"pageid":91491466,"ns":6,"title":"File:Diary 1953 (IA diary195300vand).pdf","index":2,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":10659830,"width":414,"height":650,"pagecount":168,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/25/Diary_1953_%28IA_diary195300vand%29.pdf/page1-330px-Diary_1953_%28IA_diary195300vand%29.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":1080,"thumbheight":1696,"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/25/Diary_1953_%28IA_diary195300vand%29.pdf/page1-330px-Diary_1953_%28IA_diary195300vand%29.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":1080,"height":1696},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/25/Diary_1953_%28IA_diary195300vand%29.pdf?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Diary_1953_(IA_diary195300vand).pdf","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=91491466","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2020-06-23 16:07:05","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"<div class=\"fn\">\nDiary 1953</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"PD US Government|Scans from the Internet Archive/unverified|Files from the Biodiversity Heritage Library|CC-PD-Mark|Scans from the Internet Archive|Books uploaded by F\u00e6|Books without Wikidata item|BHL Field Notes Project|Hobart Merritt Van Deusen","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Artist":{"value":"<div class=\"fn value\">\n<dl><dd>Van Deusen, Hobart M</dd>\n<dd>American Museum of Natural History. Department of Mammalogy. Archbold Expeditions Collection</dd>\n<dd>American Museum of Natural History</dd>\n<dd>Archbold Expedition to New Guinea (4th: 1953)</dd></dl></div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<div class=\"description\">\n<dl><dd>Handwritten in pocket sized daily diary</dd>\n<dd>Contains organic material pressed between pages</dd>\n<dd>Daily pocket diary kept by Van Deusen during the 4th Archbold Expedition to New Guinea. Diary has preprinted dates and informational front matter. Van Deusen's entries span from January 28, 1953 to November 28, 1953 and include very short notations of location, weather, ship coordinates, some collecting specifications, and daily activities. Also notes names of acquaintances, a packing container list, a shopping list and some expenditures. This expedition primarily collected in the Cape Vogel Peninsula of Papua New Guinea</dd>\n<dd>Hobart M. Van Deusen was a mammalogist and Assistant Curator of the Archbold Collections in the American Museum of Natural History Department of Mammalogy. He participated in the Cape York Expedition as well as three of the Archbold New Guinea Expeditions, leading the seventh in 1964</dd>\n<dd>Part of AMNH Mammalogy Departmental Library and Archives</dd>\n<dd>Cataloged through a 2015 Leon Levy Foundation Archives grant</dd></dl>\n<br>Subjects: Travel; Description and travel; Scientific expeditions; Mammals; Van Deusen, Hobart M; Archbold Expedition to New Guinea (4th: 1953)</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<dl><dd><a href=\"//archive.org/details/diary195300vand\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"iarchive:diary195300vand\"><bdi class=\"description en\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Internet Archive identifier</bdi>: diary195300vand</a></dd>\n<dd><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://archive.org/download/diary195300vand/diary195300vand.pdf\">https://archive.org/download/diary195300vand/diary195300vand.pdf</a></dd></dl>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Permission":{"value":"<a rel=\"